const SCENE_DETAILS=["The quiet garden, before the first lantern is lit.", "A little flickering lantern near the cottage.", "A second warm light beyond the flowers.", "The cottage path and the second-closest lantern are warmly lit. The nearest lantern stays unlit until Day 13.", "Green-gold fireflies drift above the flowers, distinct from the candlelight.", "Stars appear above the hills.", "A small robin rests quietly on an oak branch. Still-bird preview for size and placement review.", "The oak doorway light flickers softly.", "The cottage entrance glows and flickers.", "An upstairs cottage window lights up.", "Warm light behind the cottage glass.", "The original painted fox appears in its original place beside the path.", "Light shimmers over the distant water.", "The nearest painted lantern lights up on its stone, with a warm, gentle flicker.", "Small, subtle chimney puffs with shorter pauses.", "The little oak window glows.", "A couple of reddish oak leaves fall from their branch.", "A tiny, still owl rests in the dark nook just above the fox’s doorway.", "A tiny, still hedgehog rests on the clearer stone and moss above the nearest lantern, beside the next lantern up the path.", "The whole cottage is warmly lit.", "Two tiny, still owlets nestle beside the original owl above the fox’s door.", "The evening sky brightens gently.", "A shooting star appears promptly, then returns occasionally.", "Two small autumn pumpkins sit beside the cottage doorstep.", "Gentle ripples spread through the reflected light.", "The original fox stays in its original pose. The proposed sleeping animation is deferred.", "A tiny, still snail rests on the foreground stone in front of the nearest lantern, its shell catching the warm light.", "More reddish leaves fall, revealing a gap in the canopy and more sky.", "Two tiny baby snails follow the larger snail across the same foreground stone by the lantern.", "The original fox stays beside the path. The proposed walk to the door is deferred.", "The completed garden, with the original fox and glowing path lanterns. The proposed animal gathering is deferred. The secret room still requires the golden key."];
